cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use polished in your work, please cite it using the citation below."
type: software
title: "polished: Retrieve and Prepare GPEI POLIS Surveillance Data"
version: 0.3.0
abstract: >-
  An R package for retrieving, cleaning, standardising, and preparing
  polio surveillance data from the Global Polio Eradication Initiative
  Polio Information System (POLIS) API for reproducible epidemiological
  and surveillance analyses.
authors:
